{"id":"n28372-1-8","stage":1,"title":"단순 · 单纯","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n28372-1-8-1","ko":"일이 어려운가요?","zh":"工作有困难吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"일이","meaning":"事，工作","explanation":"일：事，工作；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91895","senseId":"5","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어려운가요?","meaning":"难，不容易","explanation":"어렵다：难，不容易；은가：询问或自问，属于较传统的非敬语句末；加 요 可提高礼貌程度。；요：增加礼貌语气。","readings":[{"term":"어렵다","audio":"/audio/55d0f08434308816bcaf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62232","senseId":"1","lemma":"어렵다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"dfc76879e2f5c3ea","term":"일","zh":"事，工作","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3","entryId":"91895","definition":"需要解决或处理的问题或事项。","pronunciation":["일ː"]},{"id":"55d0f08434308816","term":"어렵다","zh":"难，不容易","audio":"/audio/55d0f08434308816bcaf.mp3","entryId":"62232","definition":"做起来复杂或费力。","pronunciation":["어렵따"]}],"audio":"/audio/94c89bdea66d68a06916.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n28372-1-8-2","ko":"전혀요. 단순 작업이니까 금방 익힐 수 있을 거예요.","zh":"完全没有。因为是简单的任务，应该很快就能掌握的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"전혀요.","meaning":"全然","explanation":"전혀：全然；요：增加礼貌语气。","readings":[{"term":"전혀","audio":"/audio/34ef0e2fe1bc197f4478.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75769","senseId":"1","lemma":"전혀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"단순","meaning":"单纯，单一","explanation":"단순：单纯，单一","readings":[{"term":"단순","audio":"/audio/8272018cc56c46722bce.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28372","senseId":"1","lemma":"단순","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"작업이니까","meaning":"工作，作业 ，劳动","explanation":"작업：工作，作业 ，劳动；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；니까：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"작업","audio":"/audio/01dfd369cfa718dda5f1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24810","senseId":"1","lemma":"작업","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"금방","meaning":"马上，立马，很快","explanation":"금방：马上，立马，很快","readings":[{"term":"금방","audio":"/audio/08c341712591f51e062b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"34764","senseId":"4","lemma":"금방","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"익힐","meaning":"使熟练，使娴熟","explanation":"익히다：使熟练，使娴熟；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"익히다","audio":"/audio/7dd81e9447123f6b4d8f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24981","senseId":"1","lemma":"익히다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"수","meaning":"可以，可能","explanation":"수：可以，可能","readings":[{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15615","senseId":"1","lemma":"수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있을","meaning":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","explanation":"있다：能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）；을：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"5","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거예요.","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；예요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"34ef0e2fe1bc197f","term":"전혀","zh":"全然","audio":"/audio/34ef0e2fe1bc197f4478.mp3","entryId":"75769","definition":"根本；或完全。","pronunciation":["전혀"]},{"id":"8272018cc56c4672","term":"단순","zh":"单纯，单一","audio":"/audio/8272018cc56c46722bce.mp3","entryId":"28372","definition":"简单不复杂的。","pronunciation":["단순"]},{"id":"01dfd369cfa718dd","term":"작업","zh":"工作，作业 ，劳动","audio":"/audio/01dfd369cfa718dda5f1.mp3","entryId":"24810","definition":"做某事；或指该事情。","pronunciation":["자겁"]},{"id":"08c341712591f51e","term":"금방","zh":"马上，立马，很快","audio":"/audio/08c341712591f51e062b.mp3","entryId":"34764","definition":"所需时间非常短。","pronunciation":["금방"]},{"id":"7dd81e9447123f6b","term":"익히다","zh":"使熟练，使娴熟","audio":"/audio/7dd81e9447123f6b4d